      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:psephrem.asceticon.budge:1-23",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲁⲛⲇⲣⲉⲁⲥ ⲙⲡϥⲉϣⲑⲛⲟϥ ϩⲛⲟⲩⲅⲁⲙⲙⲟⲥ ⲛ**ϫⲱϩⲙ** ⲉⲧⲣⲉϥⲣϩⲁⲗ ⲛⲟⲩⲥϩⲓⲙⲉ ·",
      "english": "Andrew he could not hire in polluted marriage, and he could not make him to become the servant of a woman.",
